Example: Find the second-highest distinct salary
OptionalDouble secondHighest = employees.stream()
    .mapToDouble(Employee::getSalary)
    .distinct()
    .boxed()
    .sorted(Comparator.reverseOrder())
    .skip(1)
    .mapToDouble(Double::doubleValue)
    .findFirst();


A simpler alternative using a list:
List<Double> salaries = employees.stream()
    .map(Employee::getSalary)
    .distinct()
    .sorted(Comparator.reverseOrder())
    .collect(Collectors.toList());

if (salaries.size() >= 2) {
    System.out.println(salaries.get(1));
}


For production code, consider using BigDecimal for monetary values rather than double.
